  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Repro steps:\n\nUse SteamVR while using the Oculus Rift.\nLaunch into this world:  https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_bcf35b2c-1f04-49cc-b944-ee127c37a7ed \nWait to load in.\nPress the B button to open your menu.\nExpected:\nMenu opens.\n\nActual:\nMenu does not open. If you go around and try to interact with things in the world, things don't work either. It takes a few seconds to teleport through the door trigger, for example.\n\nOnce you've successfully used the teleporter, all the sudden the menu works...\n\nThis does not occur in the VRChat Home, so it may be related to some component in that user's world. They state that other users have experienced it in their custom home worlds.\n\nThis issue also occurs on Desktop.",
